Declarations of the string routines.

@f st_common integer
@m st_common
      external string_length,read_string,parse_string,next_token;
      integer string_length,parse_string;
      logical read_string,next_token @;

@ A string without its trailing blanks

@m trim(s) s(1:string_length(s))

